  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.22 Employee Status Notification Form B",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.22 \"Employee Status Notification Form B\" means the form or portion of a form which is required to be completed and forwarded to the council by an agency when an officer’s employment status changes under the circumstances delineated in Pol 301.06(c).\n\nSource. #1534, eff 2-17-80; ss by #1988, eff 3-25-82; ss by #2783, eff 7-27-84; ss by #4437, eff 6-22-88; ss by #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00; ss by #11196, eff 10-7-16",
